From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] clk: rockchip: Add RK3588 DisplayPort pixel clock rates

Add PLL rates for the supplied arpara modes.
Derive each rate from its DCLK and the vendor even-divider policy.
Use positive fractional coefficients within the documented VCO range.
No clock selects these rates automatically at registration.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/clk/rockchip/clk-rk3588.c b/drivers/clk/rockchip/clk-rk3588.c
--- a/drivers/clk/rockchip/clk-rk3588.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/rockchip/clk-rk3588.c
@@ -73,14 +73,20 @@
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1320000000, 2, 220, 1, 0),
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1200000000, 2, 200, 1, 0),
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1188000000, 2, 198, 1, 0),
+	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1146640000, 4, 382, 1, 13981),
+	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1146580000, 2, 191, 1, 6335),
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1100000000, 3, 550, 2, 0),
+	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1053500000, 4, 702, 2, 21845),
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1008000000, 2, 336, 2, 0),
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(1000000000, 3, 500, 2, 0),
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(983040000, 4, 655, 2, 23592),
 	RK3588_PLL_RATE(955520000, 3, 477, 2, 49806),
+	RK3588_PLL_RATE(944440000, 1, 157, 2, 26651),
